    "created_at": "2018-06-04T07:20:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-06-04T07:30:39Z",
    "body": "> https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#script-closable says the value is true if was created by a script (as opposed to by an action of the user).\r\n\r\nCurrently the spec also reads `or if it is a top-level browsing context whose session history contains only one Document`. ",
