    "updated_at": "2021-01-06T14:04:19Z",
    "body": "I think the intent of the session history check is that if a user opens a new window and then loads a page in it, that page should be able to close the window, since there is no data loss in some sense (because there is no other data).  But really, I think that check was added there to match existing behavior of some browsers.",
