    "body": "Yes, I will try to draft a PR.\n\n---\n\nIn [Chromium commit b20d6a6](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/b20d6a654f6891ed49373d9f535d8618ded1e2e2), they describe the session history check as legacy. Their [use counter](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/4414) is low. Maybe we should add a note?\n\n@natechapin",
